  "instructions": [
    "preheat grill to medium-high heat",
    "season the chicken breasts with salt, pepper, and turmeric",
    "brush the grates with olive oil to prevent sticking",
    "grill the chicken for 5-6 minutes per side, or until cooked through",
    "tent the chicken with foil if it starts to brown too quickly",
    " Meanwhile, grill the peppers and onion for 5-6 minutes, or until tender",
    "Add the garlic, turmeric, and ginger to the grill and cook for 1 minute",
    "Stir in the fish sauce and brown sugar (if using) and cook for an additional minute",
    "Transfer the chicken to a plate and cover with foil to keep warm",
    "Add the grilled peppers and onion to the plate with the chicken",
    "Serve the chicken and vegetables hot, garnished with chili flakes (if using)"
